<tr><th scope="row">Freddy AI Copilot</th><td>Listed at US$29 per agent/month on eligible Pro and Enterprise plans. <a href="https://www.freshworks.com/freshdesk/pricing/">Checked on October 28, 2026</a>.</td><td>Which agents need the add-on, and is it billed for every seat?</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row">Day passes</th><td>The pricing page lists plan-dependent day-pass rates of US$2, US$7 and US$12 for Growth, Pro and Enterprise. <a href="https://www.freshworks.com/freshdesk/pricing/">Checked on October 28, 2026</a>.</td><td>Will temporary users need access, and how are day passes counted?</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row">Connected app tasks and MCP actions</th><td>Usage-based task or action pricing is shown on the official pricing page. <a href="https://www.freshworks.com/freshdesk/pricing/">Checked on October 28, 2026</a>.</td><td>Will integrations or agentic workflows generate recurring usage charges?</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<p>Do not include AI add-ons by default just because the marketing page highlights them. Estimate the number of agents who will use Copilot and the volume of AI sessions that will be handled. If AI is a key part of the buying decision, request a written quote that spells out the allowance and overage rules.</p>
<h2 id="budget">Estimate the base cost for your team</h2>
<p>For a team of 10 paid agents, the published annual-billing monthly equivalents work out as follows before taxes, add-ons, temporary seats or discounts. These are arithmetic estimates based on the official per-agent prices, not a vendor quote.</p>
<div class="software-detail__table"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Plan</th><th scope="col">10-agent monthly equivalent</th><th scope="col">12-month base equivalent</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Growth</th><td>US$190</td><td>US$2,280</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pro</th><td>US$550</td><td>US$6,600</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Enterprise</th><td>US$890</td><td>US$10,680</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>Use your actual paid seat count. If supervisors, temporary staff or contractors need access, ask how they are billed. Also compare the plan required for each channel, SLA, dashboard or security control; moving to a higher tier can change the budget more than a small difference in base price.</p>
<h2 id="free">Does Freshdesk have a free plan?</h2>
<p>The current US pricing page lists paid plans and advertises a 14-day free trial. Freshworks also documents a separate six-month Free Program for eligible Freshdesk customers, limited to two agents and not available in Freshdesk Omni. It is not a permanent free tier, so confirm eligibility and terms in your account. Read the <a href="https://support.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/50000010099-explore-freshdesk-free-program-freshdesk-only-">official Free Program guide</a>, checked <a href="https://support.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/50000010099-explore-freshdesk-free-program-freshdesk-only-">October 28, 2026</a>.</p>
<h2 id="choose">Which plan should you choose?</h2>
<div class="software-detail__decision"><h3>Choose Growth when</h3><p>Your team needs core email-first ticketing, a customer portal, a knowledge base and basic support reporting. Confirm that the standard Freshdesk channel set covers the requests you receive.</p></div>
<div class="software-detail__decision"><h3>Consider Pro when</h3><p>More detailed dashboards, routing controls or multiple SLA policies are required to manage the queue. Compare the price increase with the hours saved by those controls.</p></div>
<div class="software-detail__decision"><h3>Consider Enterprise when</h3><p>Audit logs, sandboxing, advanced routing or enterprise administration are real requirements. Ask the vendor to demonstrate the specific control in your proposed configuration.</p></div>
<h2>Before you buy</h2>
<ul><li>Confirm whether you need standard Freshdesk or Freshdesk Omni.</li><li>Count paid seats and identify any temporary users.</li><li>List required channels, SLAs, dashboards, permissions and security controls.</li><li>Estimate AI Agent sessions and Copilot seats separately.</li><li>Ask for a written quote with billing cadence, overage rules, renewal terms and taxes.</li></ul>
<p>For product fit, read the <a href="/freshdesk/review/">Freshdesk review</a>. If the plan cost does not match your needs, compare <a href="/freshdesk/alternatives/">Freshdesk alternatives</a> or the existing <a href="/compare/zendesk-vs-freshdesk/">Zendesk vs Freshdesk comparison</a>. This guide uses the <a href="https://www.freshworks.com/freshdesk/pricing/">official pricing page</a> and <a href="https://www.freshworks.com/freshdesk/new-features/">official product updates</a> checked October 28, 2026.</p>
