<p>This comparison uses official product, pricing and help documentation. It is not a hands-on test or independent performance benchmark. For individual product fit, read the <a href="/zendesk/alternatives/">Zendesk alternatives guide</a> and <a href="/freshdesk/alternatives/">Freshdesk alternatives guide</a>.</p>
